### Read all users
GET http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users

### Create a new user (No Hash)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Charlie", 
    "role": "admin",
    "email": "charlie7@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Create a new user with bcrypt hash ✅
POST http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/hash
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "SecureUser", 
    "role": "user",
    "email": "secure@example.com",
    "password": "mySecurePassword123"
}

### Login - Success ✅
POST http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "secure@example.com",
    "password": "mySecurePassword123"
}

### Login - Wrong Password ❌
POST http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "secure@example.com",
    "password": "wrongPassword"
}

### Login - User Not Found ❌
POST http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "notexist@example.com",
    "password": "anyPassword"
}

### Update a user
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/6a06ad3401facfee7966fc0f
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Neeti3", 
    "email": "charlie@example.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Update a user - trigger catch (invalid ObjectId causes CastError)
PUT http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/not-a-valid-id
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "TriggerError"
}

### DELETE a user
DELETE http://localhost:3002/api/v2/users/6a06ad3401facfee7966fc0f